                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN UND VORRICHTUNG ZUR BESTIMMUNG DER ENERGIESPARSIGNALÜBERWACHUNGSGELEGENHEIT UND ENDGERÄTEVORRICHTUNG</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ ET APPAREIL DE DÉTERMINATION D'OCCASION DE SURVEILLANCE DE SIGNAL D'ÉCONOMIE D'ÉNERGIE, ET DISPOSITIF TERMINAL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD AND APPARATUS FOR DETERMINING ENERGY-SAVING SIGNAL MONITORING OCCASION, AND TERMINAL DEVICE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments of the present application provide an energy-saving method and net, the method being executed by a network device. The method includes: sending an energy-saving signal to a terminal device; wherein the energy-saving signal is a Paging Early Indication (PEI), and the PEI is used to indicate whether the terminal device should monitor a paging Physical Downlink Control Channel (PDCCH) on the target PO before arrival of a target Paging Occasion (PO).</p>
            </abstract>
